ration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.step_frobenius/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.step_spectral/preferred"],"comparison":"These are supporting implications whose hypotheses are precisely the stated analytic assumptions or recurrences. Their conclusions supply intermediate bounds/correspondences, not assumptions of the final source theorem. The source descent and momentum-drift clauses follow from the two separate smoothness assumptions, polar trace/rank bounds and the explicit recurrences. Frobenius remainders carry r and sqrt(r), whereas spectral remainders omit the smoothness rank factor.","id":"topic:logic","source":["src_14670a605a09aa7228c37b5f","src_810258311d12db534bffdb5a","src_ac4f7c4148499f51f57d71f0","src_00167cec31f9464272a951c3","src_0d022ab50f72710bbac19f68","src_1d45c852c8daf18d1ec34ba6","src_5674d5dd2d22ede07cdd7fdc","src_7775f71a39b603ed1c47e2eb","src_c762bf7895696c5fa21bdf72","src_ac7bad2cdc3ee5d628f7760f","src_4be5fa36b02e46b2459b3b72","src_f6b6019a849077b1a45ce542","src_f8e9be31fd6e88fb1e905520","src_969f18856b5c57ac143274ca","src_1d84230d8e108553e6f125eb","src_32f4ef1544cd9c20a4a237c9","src_0435e80d4823caf35ecf6eaa","src_a8b804f2afa9050968e7d456"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.descent_of_inner_bound/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.frobenius_descent/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.hasDerivAt_line/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_tracking_frobenius/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_tracking_spectral/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.spectral_descent/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.step_frobenius/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.step_spectral/preferred"],"comparison":"The source descent and momentum-drift clauses follow from the two separate smoothness assumptions, polar trace/rank bounds and the explicit recurrences. Frobenius remainders carry r and sqrt(r), whereas spectral remainders omit the smoothness rank factor.","id":"topic:assumptions","source":["src_14670a605a09aa7228c37b5f","src_810258311d12db534bffdb5a","src_ac4f7c4148499f51f57d71f0","src_00167cec31f9464272a951c3","src_0d022ab50f72710bbac19f68","src_1d45c852c8daf18d1ec34ba6","src_5674d5dd2d22ede07cdd7fdc","src_7775f71a39b603ed1c47e2eb","src_c762bf7895696c5fa21bdf72","src_ac7bad2cdc3ee5d628f7760f","src_4be5fa36b02e46b2459b3b72","src_f6b6019a849077b1a45ce542","src_f8e9be31fd6e88fb1e905520","src_969f18856b5c57ac143274ca","src_1d84230d8e108553e6f125eb","src_32f4ef1544cd9c20a4a237c9","src_0435e80d4823caf35ecf6eaa","src_a8b804f2afa9050968e7d456"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.descent_of_inner_bound/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.frobenius_descent/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.hasDerivAt_line/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_tracking_frobenius/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_tracking_spectral/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.spectral_descent/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.step_frobenius/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.step_spectral/preferred"],"comparison":"For eta>0,L>=0 the source step yields eta*nuclearNorm(grad f W)<=fW-f(W-eta polar M)+r L eta^2/2+2 eta sqrt(r)||grad f W-M||_F. The factor2 and rank placement agree with the source error split. For eta>0,Ls>=0 the corresponding inequality is eta*nuclearNorm(grad f W)<=decrease+Ls eta^2/2+2 eta*nuclearNorm(grad f W-M), with no spurious r factor in the smoothness term. The hypotheses explicitly fix W_(t+1)=W_t-eta polar(M_t), M0=G0, the momentum recurrence and centered-noise recurrence D0=G0-grad f(W0). For 0<=beta<1 the drift bound is ||grad f(W_t)-M_t||_F<=||D_t||_F+sqrt(r) beta L eta/(1-beta). Under the same exact initializations and recurrences, source spectral smoothness gives nuclearNorm(grad f(W_t)-M_t)<=sqrt(r)||D_t||_F+beta Ls eta/(1-beta). The rank factor multiplies noise only.","id":"topic:expressions","source":["src_14670a605a09aa7228c37b5f","src_810258311d12db534bffdb5a","src_ac4f7c4148499f51f57d71f0","src_00167cec31f9464272a951c3","src_0d022ab50f72710bbac19f68","src_1d45c852c8daf18d1ec34ba6","src_5674d5dd2d22ede07cdd7fdc","src_7775f71a39b603ed1c47e2eb","src_c762bf7895696c5fa21bdf72","src_ac7bad2cdc3ee5d628f7760f","src_4be5fa36b02e46b2459b3b72","src_f6b6019a849077b1a45ce542","src_f8e9be31fd6e88fb1e905520","src_969f18856b5c57ac143274ca","src_1d84230d8e108553e6f125eb","src_32f4ef1544cd9c20a4a237c9","src_0435e80d4823caf35ecf6eaa","src_a8b804f2afa9050968e7d456"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.descent_of_inner_bound/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.frobenius_descent/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.hasDerivAt_line/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_tracking_frobenius/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.momentum_tracking_spectral/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.spectral_descent/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.step_frobenius/preferred","candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.step_spectral/preferred"],"comparison":"The polar direction uses the new momentum M_t and the update W_(t+1)=W_t-eta polar M_t. Initialization M0=G0 is explicit in both tracking theorems.","id":"topic:algorithm","source":["src_14670a605a09aa7228c37b5f","src_810258311d12db534bffdb5a","src_ac4f7c4148499f51f57d71f0","src_00167cec31f9464272a951c3","src_0d022ab50f72710bbac19f68","src_1d45c852c8daf18d1ec34ba6","src_5674d5dd2d22ede07cdd7fdc","src_7775